# Web sandbox

Design spikes that need Grafy chrome live in `apps/web/src/sandbox/`, routed at `/sandbox` (dev only).

- Import real tokens, `overlay`, `CatalogNodePreview`, `portMarkStyle`. Do not draw a fake node.
- Sandbox may import `features/` / `components/` / `lib/`. Those trees must never import sandbox.
- Do not patch product files (`WorkflowNode`, `type-inspector`, etc.) to make a spike render.
- Register new spikes in `apps/web/src/sandbox/catalog.ts` and `SpikeHost.tsx`.
- Cursor `.canvas.tsx` files cannot import Grafy — use this sandbox when shape and type color matter.

See `apps/web/src/sandbox/README.md`.
